{
  "name": "history-quarters-change-no-transition",
  "description": "A history entry without a transition: a 1 January calendar changes its quarters from 3-3-3-3 months to 4-4-4 months from 2025-01-01, which is a year boundary of both rules. The canonical form writes the entry's transition as null. Years from 2025 have three quarters, so quarter 4 of 2025 is PERIOD_NOT_FOUND and 'FY2025 Q4' is LABEL_NOT_RECOGNISED; shift counts each year's own quarters. Numbered by 'start', the years are consecutive across the change. Illustrative.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "oracle",
    "citation": "Independent implementation of the spec in conformance/generators/fiscal_oracle.py, written with Python datetime and no fiscalclock code",
    "url": null,
    "checked_by": "fiscal_oracle.py: Calendar.seq built from the regimes and transitions; change_errors and naming_errors pass"
  },
